WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.213 --> 00:00:17.468
"I love days at school," Nina said.

2
00:00:18.248 --> 00:00:20.290
She and Izzie were on their way to Kids Central.

3
00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:21.371
"Me too!"

4
00:00:21.632 --> 00:00:22.232
Izzie said.

5
00:00:22.252 --> 00:00:25.956
"We get to be with Miss Shelly all afternoon!"

6
00:00:28.512 --> 00:00:30.273
The girls joined the others in the gym.

7
00:00:30.293 --> 00:00:33.975
"Did everyone bring warm clothes?"

8
00:00:34.235 --> 00:00:35.176
Miss Shelly asked.

9
00:00:35.196 --> 00:00:36.977
"I did!"

10
00:00:37.397 --> 00:00:39.759
Bobby pulled on a wool hat with ear flaps.

11
00:00:41.019 --> 00:00:43.381
Jason lifted his leg to show his snow boots.

12
00:00:44.741 --> 00:00:46.482
Ethan looked out the window and shivered.

13
00:00:47.323 --> 00:00:49.844
The sun was shining, but there was snow on the ground.

14
00:00:49.864 --> 00:00:53.646
"Are we really going outside today?"

15
00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:56.008
"Yep," Miss Shelly said.

16
00:00:56.744 --> 00:00:58.325
"I want to show you something."

17
00:00:59.546 --> 00:01:00.907
Ethan didn't look too happy.

18
00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:04.589
"The sun's warm," Jason said.

19
00:01:04.609 --> 00:01:07.250
"And there's snow," Bobby added.

20
00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.853
"We can build a fort!"

21
00:01:14.054 --> 00:01:17.716
When they got outside, everyone gathered around a picnic table.

22
00:01:18.357 --> 00:01:20.638
There was a funny-looking box sitting on the table.

23
00:01:20.658 --> 00:01:22.719
"What's that?"

24
00:01:23.159 --> 00:01:23.880
Izzie asked.

25
00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:27.962
"It's a solar oven," Miss Shelly said.

26
00:01:27.982 --> 00:01:30.743
"It cooks with the heat of the sun.

27
00:01:31.544 --> 00:01:33.205
I use it when I go camping."

28
00:01:34.746 --> 00:01:36.106
Jason wrinkled his nose.

29
00:01:36.126 --> 00:01:38.268
"How does it work?"

30
00:01:38.568 --> 00:01:39.148
he asked.

31
00:01:39.168 --> 00:01:41.610
"There's no gas or electricity."

32
00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:45.272
"We cooked with solar ovens on the beach in California!"

33
00:01:45.612 --> 00:01:46.312
Ethan said.

34
00:01:46.332 --> 00:01:48.674
"Sunlight is the fuel.

35
00:01:49.734 --> 00:01:52.476
The shiny metal reflects the sun and creates heat."

36
00:01:54.108 --> 00:01:56.350
"That's right, Ethan," Miss Shelly said.

37
00:01:56.370 --> 00:02:00.513
"But I didn't know they worked in cold weather," Ethan said.

38
00:02:00.533 --> 00:02:05.837
"You can cook with the sun any time of year," Miss Shelly said.

39
00:02:05.857 --> 00:02:09.920
"Today we're going to make sweet potato fries."

40
00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:12.802
"Mmm," Nina said.

41
00:02:12.822 --> 00:02:14.403
"What do we do?"

42
00:02:15.404 --> 00:02:17.405
Miss Shelly had a bag of supplies with her.

43
00:02:18.146 --> 00:02:20.908
She pulled out sweet potatoes, olive oil and salt.

44
00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:24.061
She also had a knife and a cutting board.

45
00:02:24.081 --> 00:02:31.164
"First, we slice these sweet potatoes into strips like french fries.

46
00:02:32.384 --> 00:02:36.106
Then we coat them with oil and sprinkle on salt."

47
00:02:36.126 --> 00:02:39.847
"Sounds easy," Jason said.

48
00:02:39.867 --> 00:02:48.391
"Good!" When the potatoes were ready, Miss Shelly slid the pan inside the solar oven.

49
00:02:48.411 --> 00:02:50.432
"Are you cold, Ethan?

50
00:02:51.272 --> 00:02:53.733
We can go back inside while the fries cook."

51
00:02:54.614 --> 00:02:55.594
Ethan shook his head.

52
00:02:55.614 --> 00:02:57.435
"Nope. Jason was right.

53
00:02:58.036 --> 00:02:59.176
The sun feels warm."

54
00:03:00.157 --> 00:03:01.097
He looked at Bobby.

55
00:03:01.117 --> 00:03:03.559
"What were you saying about building a fort?"

56
00:03:07.141 --> 00:03:09.982
Soon the kids were busy piling snow in a big mound.

57
00:03:11.703 --> 00:03:13.764
They dug out the center so they could all fit.

58
00:03:14.885 --> 00:03:17.446
Forty minutes later Miss Shelly went over to the oven.

59
00:03:17.466 --> 00:03:20.968
"Who wants some sweet potato fries?"

60
00:03:22.308 --> 00:03:25.911
"Me!" The kids came piling out of the snow fort.

61
00:03:25.931 --> 00:03:27.592
"I do!"

62
00:03:28.933 --> 00:03:30.394
Miss Shelly held out the pan.

63
00:03:31.775 --> 00:03:33.516
The fries looked brown and crispy.

64
00:03:33.536 --> 00:03:37.319
"Let's go inside to eat," Miss Shelly said.

65
00:03:37.339 --> 00:03:39.741
"Can we come back out later?"

66
00:03:40.081 --> 00:03:40.742
Ethan asked.

67
00:03:40.762 --> 00:03:43.924
"Absolutely!" Miss Shelly agreed.

68
00:03:43.944 --> 00:03:47.987
"Today we've got all afternoon to play."

69
00:03:49.832 --> 00:03:52.434
On the way back inside, Bobby turned to Ethan.

70
00:03:52.455 --> 00:03:55.057
"Did you know you can surf on snow?"

71
00:03:55.077 --> 00:03:57.759
"Huh?" Ethan was confused.

72
00:03:57.779 --> 00:04:00.402
"It's called snowboarding.

73
00:04:01.042 --> 00:04:02.904
My dad is taking me this weekend.

74
00:04:03.724 --> 00:04:05.046
Maybe you can come with us."

75
00:04:06.247 --> 00:04:07.408
"That would be awesome!"

76
00:04:08.168 --> 00:04:08.969
Ethan grinned.

77
00:04:08.989 --> 00:04:11.772
"The cold isn't so bad when you're having fun!"
